+IMX README
+===========
+
+How to build imx-vulkan-cts
+-------------
+
+* source your toolchian
+* cmake .. -G Ninja -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release -DSELECTED_BUILD_TARGETS="deqp-vk" -DDEQP_SUPPORT_VULKAN_VIDEO=OFF -DDEQP_TARGET=wayland -DCMAKE_C_FLAGS=-m64 -DCMAKE_CXX_FLAGS=-m64 -DCMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM=3.5
+* ninja -j16
+
+How to run imx-vulkan-cts
+-------------
+
+* ./deqp-vk --deqp-caselist-file=/your_path/VK-GL-CTS/external/vulkancts/mustpass/main/vk-default.txt --deqp-waiver-file=/your_path/mali_driver_vulkancts_waiver.xml
+
+
+Branch Track
+-------------
+
+* imx-vulkan-cts-1.4.5.2 : 2026.Q3
